--><rss xmlns:sparkle="http://www.andymatuschak.org/xml-namespaces/sparkle" version="2.0"><channel><title>AndroidADBTool 更新</title><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>AndroidADBTool 1.0.17</title><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:58:44 GMT</pubDate><sparkle:version>20261119095720</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.17</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;新增问答项目管理，粘贴链接即可自动识别项目名称并生成入口，后续添加服务无需改代码或重新安装。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;支持编辑项目名称和服务地址、调整排序、移除入口，配置保存在本机，最多管理 20 个项目。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;预设加入 Hider2、Gallery2 和 XGallery，保留原有 AppLock 入口和自定义地址。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;切换项目时保留各自网页会话，并记住上次选择；移除入口不删除服务中的对话记录。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;完善离线服务保存、重复链接拦截和配置校验，取消操作不会保存草稿。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kechangjie/android_tool_plus-updates/releases/download/v1.0.17/AndroidADBTool-1.0.17-20261119095720-AppleSilicon.zip" length="31920589" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="lCKXGWkktQrNhA7UCFgpfwddrmhTPHWhei1tS7S7bex6vY1GFnDRwzmQQXGlJpmKeHW2zG0JS80OpFjd9ONFAg=="></enclosure><sparkle:deltas><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kechangjie/android_tool_plus-updates/releases/download/v1.0.17/AndroidADBTool-1.0.17-20261119095720-from-20261118112639-AppleSilicon.delta" length="1471198" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:deltaFrom="20261118112639" sparkle:edSignature="bKq8NKmyyWWo93EgvsvZ4ExOtYnpCxU5lT5JVKSmjq80zoiTBw7FLBxjfM6Lza0ITqZQnvAcXn8SG291eRUzAA==" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleExecutableSize="977616" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleLocales="Base,ar,ca,cs,da,de,el,es,fa,fi,fr,he,hr,hu,is,it,ja,ko,nb,nl,nn,pl,pt-BR,pt-PT,ro,ru,sk,sl,sv,th,tr,uk,vi,zh_CN,zh_HK,zh_TW"></enclosure><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kech